    description: 'Firefox & Safari fallback to new tab, or your custom handler (e.g. a modal).',
    colorClasses: 'bg-[var(--note-cyan-bg)] border-[var(--note-cyan-line)] text-[var(--note-cyan-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--note-cyan-hover)]',
    rotation: 'rotate-[1.5deg]',
  },
  {
    icon: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-5 h-5"><path d="M5.25 14.25h13.5m-13.5 0a3 3 0 01-3-3m3 3a3 3 0 100 6h13.5a3 3 0 100-6m-16.5-3a3 3 0 013-3h13.5a3 3 0 013 3m-19.5 0a4.5 4.5 0 01.9-2.7L5.737 5.1a3.375 3.375 0 012.7-1.35h7.126c1.062 0 2.062.5 2.7 1.35l2.587 3.45a4.5 4.5 0 01.9 2.7m0 0a3 3 0 01-3 3m0 3h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0-6h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm-3 6h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0-6h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z"/></svg>`,
    title: 'SSR-Safe',
    description: 'Works in Next.js, Remix, and Vite out of the box. No hydration mismatches.',
    colorClasses: 'bg-[var(--note-yellow-bg)] border-[var(--note-yellow-line)] text-[var(--note-yellow-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--note-yellow-hover)]',
    rotation: 'rotate-[-2.5deg]',
  },
  {
    icon: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-5 h-5"><path d="M13.19 8.688a4.5 4.5 0 011.242 7.244l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 01-6.364-6.364l1.757-1.757m9.86-2.54a4.5 4.5 0 00-1.242-7.244l-4.5-4.5a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 6.364L4.34 8.586" transform="translate(2, 2) scale(0.83)"/></svg>`,
